.TH geectl-gitea-repo-search 1  "geectl-gitea-repo-search 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-gitea\-repo\-search \- Search repositories across the instance by keyword: the keyword matches the name and the description. The Gitea counterpart of `remote search\-packages` / `remote search\-projects`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl gitea repo\-search\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIQUERY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search repositories across the instance by keyword: the keyword matches the name and the description. The Gitea counterpart of `remote search\-packages` / `remote search\-projects`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIQUERY\fR>
The search keyword
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
